# ============================================================
# Rust build artifacts
# ============================================================
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo profiling / coverage outputs
*.profraw
tarpaulin-report.html
flamegraph.svg
perf.data
perf.data.old

# Note: Cargo.lock IS committed (this is a binary application).

# ============================================================
# AI assistant context / tooling.
# Shared project collaboration info IS version-controlled:
#   CLAUDE.md  and  .claude/{rules,commands,agents,skills,hooks,
#   agent-memory,settings.json}
# Only per-user / machine-specific state and other tools' files
# stay ignored (below).
# ============================================================
# (gitignore has no inline comments — keep notes on their own lines.)
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.cursorrules
.cursor/
.windsurfrules
.aider*
.continue/
.copilot-*
.github/copilot-instructions.md
# repo-root scratch memory dir (NOT the shared .claude/agent-memory):
/memory/

# Per-user / machine-specific AI tooling state (NOT shared):
.claude/settings.local.json
.agent/
.codex/
.opencode/

# ============================================================
# Secrets / credentials
# ============================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.toml

# ============================================================
# OS metadata
# ============================================================
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ============================================================
# Editors / IDEs
# ============================================================
.vscode/
.idea/
.zed/
.fleet/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*~
.project
.settings/
.classpath

# ============================================================
# Runtime artifacts: KEGG cache, logs, downloads
# ============================================================
/data/cache/
*.log
logs/
*.bak
*.tmp

# Local "bad" MS-DIAL fixture (~28 MB, manual gate testing only). Purged from
# git history; kept as a local-only file. Path corrected from the old stale rule.
/data/single-mode/MS-DIAL-output-example-bad.txt

# ============================================================
# Runtime-generated CSV exports from manual GUI testing.
# `data/MS-DIAL-output-example.txt` and `data/metadata-example.csv`
# are example INPUTS (committed); `dam.csv`, `all_results.csv`, and
# `enrichment.csv` are runtime OUTPUTS that users download and rerun.
# ============================================================
/data/dam.csv
/data/all_results.csv
/data/enrichment.csv

# Per-session bug-report bundles downloaded from the GUI's
# [Download bug report…] button. Personal diagnostic snapshots —
# never check these in.
/data/**/bug-report-*.zip
/data/**/bug-report-*/

# Settings snapshots saved from the GUI's [Save settings…] button.
# Personal parameter dumps, regenerated on demand — never check in
# (one landed in docs/screenshots/ during manual screenshotting).
metabolopan-settings-*.json

# ============================================================
# Personal todo notes outside the OpenSpec workflow. These are
# rough roadmap reminders, not formal change proposals.
# ============================================================
/todo/

# ============================================================
# Planning / scratchpad files outside the openspec workflow
# ============================================================
/plan.md
/plans/
/scratch/
/.tmp/

# ============================================================
# Local test outputs
# ============================================================
/test-output/
/reports/
*.snap.new

# Runtime PNGs from `cargo run --example render_dotplot_demo`
# and `--example render_typography_review`
# (visual verification scratch — regenerated on demand).
/dotplot_demo*.png
/typography_*.png

# Dot-plot renders saved into data/ during manual GUI testing (scratch).
/data/enrichment-dotplot*.png
